    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.FixAuthlib.ToolTip">Some versions, including 1.16.5, may disable multiplayer when an offline account is used. PCL can update Authlib to correct this.&#x0a;This affects only newly installed instances.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.InstallBehavior">Install behavior</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.SpeedLimit">Speed limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.SpeedLimit.ToolTip">Limits download speed so other apps can continue using the network smoothly.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.TargetFolder">Target folder</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.TargetFolder.Hint">Change the destination in Launch → Choose Instance → Folder List.&#x0a;Right-click a folder or instance to open it in File Explorer.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.Threads">Maximum threads</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.Threads.ToolTip">More threads can improve speed when a server limits each connection, but very high values may make the launcher less responsive.&#x0a;64 threads is enough for most downloads.</sys:String>
