    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Experimental.HomepageUi.Summary">Uses the redesigned Launch page, full-page version library, full-page version settings, frosted title bar, and glass floating actions. Other feature pages will gradually move to this experimental UI as well.</sys:String>
